{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10778","headline":"大麦行 · 杜甫","name":"大麦行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大麦乾枯小麦黄，妇女行泣夫走藏。\n东至集壁西梁洋，问谁腰镰胡与羌。\n岂无蜀兵三千人，部领辛苦江山长。\n安得如鸟有羽翅，托身白云还故乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10778.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10778","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《杜诗详注》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/杜詩詳註_(四庫全書本)）"}